---
// Campaign2Hero.astro
---

<header
  class="relative pt-16 pb-24 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-32 bg-white overflow-hidden"
  id="hero"
>
  <!-- Subtle gradient background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white -z-10">
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    <div
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-semibold text-sm mb-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm mx-auto"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-4 h-4 text-tally-500"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      A smarter alternative to hiring one accountant
    </div>

    <h1
      class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-tight mb-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto"
    >
      Get a CA-Led Finance Team. <span
        class="text-tally-600 relative inline-block"
        >Without the Cost<svg
          class="absolute w-full h-3 -bottom-1 left-0 text-tally-200 -z-10"
          viewBox="0 0 100 10"
          preserveAspectRatio="none"
          ><path
            d="M0 5 Q 50 10 100 5"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="3"
            fill="none"></path></svg
        ></span
      > of Another Full-Time Hire.
    </h1>

    <p
      class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
    >
      Get bookkeeping, reconciliations, GST/TDS compliance and reporting handled
      by a CA-led, AI-trained team - with built-in backup and broader expertise
      than relying on one person.
    </p>

    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-10"
    >
      <a
        href="#hero-form"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-tally-600 hover:bg-tally-700 text-white font-bold text-xl px-12 py-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-tally-600/30"
      >
        See Where Your Finance Gaps Are
      </a>
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-base font-medium text-slate-700"
    >
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg
          class="w-5 h-5 text-tally-500"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
        >
        CA-led team
      </span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg
          class="w-5 h-5 text-tally-500"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
        >
        AI-enabled workflows
      </span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg
          class="w-5 h-5 text-tally-500"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
        >
        Built-in backup
      </span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg
          class="w-5 h-5 text-tally-500"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
        >
        Broader finance expertise
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
